# ShuWei Cup project rule

Before making changes:

1. Confirm the terminal is WSL: `uname -a` shows Linux and `pwd` is `/home/mary/shuwei2026`.
2. Read `AGENTS.md`.
3. Read `docs/collab/CURSOR_HANDOFF.md` and run `git status --short --branch`.
4. Check the agent bus before starting work:
   `python3 tools/agent_bus/bus.py inbox --agent cursor --unread`
